business, or profit-making purpose. Prohibited uses include:

- Selling, renting, paid licensing, subscriptions, advertising revenue,
  sponsorship revenue, or revenue sharing involving the Work;
- Paid development, customization, installation, deployment, maintenance,
  training, consulting, or hosting services;
- Commercial venues, paid experiences, commercial exhibitions, customer
  projects, internal business operations, or marketing and lead generation;
- Manufacturing or selling devices, souvenirs, NFC products, or customized
